  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is based on a extended Memorandum of Understanding with the cooperating Supreme Audit Institution (SAI). Main objective is good governance and anti-corruption. Institutional strengthening with focus on regularity audit, performance audit and IT</narrative>
